<title>UK: CRICKET-NOTTINGHAMSHIRE 92-2 AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NOTTINGHAMSHIRE 92-2 AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nottinghamshire</p>
<p>were 92 for two at lunch after being put in to bat by Australia</p>
<p>on the second day of their three-day match at Trent Bridge on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
</text>
